## 14.4 Sync Queue Workflow

### 14.4.1 Local → Edge Sync Path

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant POS as POS Client (Tauri+React)
    participant Local as Local SQLite (mutation_records)
    participant Tokio as Tokio Async Sync Daemon
    participant DO as Durable Object (LocationSyncRoom)
    participant D1 as Cloudflare D1

    POS->>Local: ADD item to order
    Local->>Local: INSERT INTO mutation_records (status=pending, payload, signature)
    
    par Non-blocking (completes <1ms)
        POS-->>POS: Return order receipt
    and Background Sync
        Tokio->>Local: SELECT * FROM mutation_records WHERE status='pending'
        Tokio->>DO: WebSocket Frame (MutationEnvelope JSON)
        DO->>Tokio: Ack (settled)
        Tokio->>Local: UPDATE mutation_records SET status='settled'
    and D1 Replication
        DO->>D1: Batched async INSERT INTO orders (every 5s or on settlement)
        D1-->DO: Replication acknowledged
    end
```

### 14.4.2 Sync Daemon Configuration

**Per `apps/pos-client/src/sync/`**:

| Setting | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `sync_interval_ms` | `5000` | How often daemon checks for pending mutations |
| `batch_size` | `50` | Max mutations per WebSocket frame |
| `retry_backoff_ms` | `1000` | Exponential backoff on WebSocket failure |
| `max_retries` | `10` | Give up after N attempts; mark mutation `conflict` |

