## 14.5 Offline-First Behavior

### 15.5.1 No Network Connection

If network is lost:

1. **POS continues operating**: Local SQLite accepts all writes
2. **Mutation recorded**: `mutation_records` status=pending, signed locally
3. **UI remains responsive**: No "offline mode" banner unless explicitly checked
4. **SLA timers**: Run locally (system time); may drift if no NTP for extended periods
5. **KDS updates**: Buffered locally; sent when network restores

### 15.5.2 Network Restored

1. **Tokio daemon detects** connectivity restoration
2. **Flushes pending mutations** via WebSocket to Durable Object
3. **D1 replicates** batched mutations (every 5s or on settlement)
4. **Conflict resolution**: Vector clocks merged; if conflicts, status=`conflict`
5. **UI updates**: Show "Sync complete" banner; any conflicts presented to operator

### 15.5.3 Data Consistency Guarantees

| Data Type | Consistency Model |
|---|---|
| **Order financials** | LWW; latest total_cents wins |
| **Stock levels** | PN Counter; net increment/decrement |
| **86'd items** | OR-Set; union of all observers' views |
| **KDS ticket status** | Last-write-wins; DO is source of truth |
| **Audit events** | Append-only; never overwritten |

