## 14.6 TypeScript Sync Integration (per `08_typescript-standards.md`)

### 14.6.1 UseSync Hook (conceptual, in `apps/pos-client/src/hooks/`)

```tsx
import { useSync } from '@/lib/sync';

function useOrderSync(orderId: string) {
  const [localState, syncStatus] = useSync(orderId);
  
  // localState: readable/writable copy; syncStatus: 'idle' | 'syncing' | 'conflict'
  
  return {
    ...localState,
    isSyncing: syncStatus === 'syncing',
    onConflict: (resolution) => { /* resolve via API */ }
  };
}
```

### 14.6.2 Sync Status Display

**Kiosk/Manager view** shows:
- Green dot: "Synced"
- Yellow dot: "Syncing..." 
- Red dot: "Conflict - needs attention"
- Clickable to view conflict details and resolve

